<title>FRANCE: AXA, UAP remain suspended.</title>
<headline>AXA, UAP remain suspended.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Stock Exchanges' Association SBF said that the shares of insurers AXA and UAP, as well as Finaxa and underlying warrants would remain suspended until further notice.</p>
<p>The shares were suspended on Tuesday ahead of the announcement of a merger plan.</p>
<p>The SBF said that the Financial Markets' Committee would study the merger proposal and make its decision within the usual time limits.</p>
</text>
